## Student Gradebook

### Student and Grade Structures

```xiom
type Grade {
  subject: Str;
  score: Int;
  max_score: Int;
}

type Student {
  name: Str;
  grades: Vec[Grade];
}

type Gradebook {
  students: Vec[Student];
}
```

### Adding Grades

```xiom
requires { score >= 0; }
requires { score <= max_score; }
fn add_grade(student: &mut Student, subject: Str, score: Int, max_score: Int) {
  student.grades.push(Grade{ subject: subject, score: score, max_score: max_score });
}
```

The contract guarantees scores are valid (0 to max). No negative scores, no 110/100.

### Calculating Averages

```xiom
fn student_average(student: &Student) -> Int {
  if student.grades.len() == 0 { return 0; };
  let mut total = 0;
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < student.grades.len() {
    let g = student.grades.get(i).unwrap();
    total += g.score * 100 / g.max_score;
    i += 1;
  };
  total / student.grades.len()
}

fn subject_average(gradebook: &Gradebook, subject: Str) -> Int {
  let mut total = 0;
  let mut count = 0;
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < gradebook.students.len() {
    let student = gradebook.students.get(i).unwrap();
    let mut j = 0;
    while j < student.grades.len() {
      let g = student.grades.get(j).unwrap();
      if g.subject == subject {
        total += g.score;
        count += 1;
      };
      j += 1;
    };
    i += 1;
  };
  if count == 0 { return 0; };
  total / count
}
```

### Top Performers

```xiom
fn top_student(gradebook: &Gradebook) -> Option<Str> {
  if gradebook.students.len() == 0 { return Option.None; };
  let mut best_idx = 0;
  let mut best_avg = student_average(gradebook.students.get(0).unwrap());
  let mut i = 1;
  while i < gradebook.students.len() {
    let avg = student_average(gradebook.students.get(i).unwrap());
    if avg > best_avg {
      best_avg = avg;
      best_idx = i;
    };
    i += 1;
  };
  Option.Some(gradebook.students.get(best_idx).unwrap().name.clone())
}
```

### Report Card

```xiom
fn print_report_card(student: &Student) {
  let avg = student_average(student);
  let letter = grade_to_letter(avg);

  io.println(student.name);
  io.println(avg);
  io.println(letter);

  let mut i = 0;
  while i < student.grades.len() {
    let g = student.grades.get(i).unwrap();
    io.println(g.subject);
    io.println(g.score);
    i += 1;
  };
}
```

